# Review is requested automatically from these owners. It is only required to
# merge if the branch protection rule on main says "Require review from Code
# Owners" (a repository setting, not a file).
#
# The paths are the ones where a mistake can delete someone's files or weaken
# a guard: see docs/THREAT_MODEL.md.

# The only code allowed to delete, move or run mutating commands
/internal/executor/    @sagnik26

# What decides whether a path may ever be touched, and what a plan may contain
/internal/safety/      @sagnik26
/internal/planner/     @sagnik26
/internal/precond/     @sagnik26
/internal/pathfold/    @sagnik26

# What macdoc is allowed to act on, and the commands it may run
/internal/recipes/catalog/  @sagnik26
/internal/recipes/load.go   @sagnik26

# The checks that keep the rules above true
/scripts/              @sagnik26
/tools/forbidcheck/    @sagnik26
/.github/              @sagnik26
/.golangci.yml         @sagnik26

# The rules themselves
/docs/SAFETY_MODEL.md  @sagnik26
/docs/THREAT_MODEL.md  @sagnik26
/docs/adr/             @sagnik26
